WEBVTT

00:18:58.061 --> 00:19:01.168
But I was only able to start
changing my life

00:19:01.192 --> 00:19:05.257
when I realized your depression
is not a malfunction.

00:19:06.620 --> 00:19:07.770
It's a signal.

00:19:08.684 --> 00:19:10.691
Your depression is a signal.

00:19:11.077 --> 00:19:12.918
It's telling you something.

00:19:12.942 --> 00:19:17.553
(Applause)

00:19:17.577 --> 00:19:19.966
We feel this way for reasons,

00:19:19.990 --> 00:19:22.705
and they can be hard to see
in the throes of depression --

00:19:22.729 --> 00:19:25.339
I understand that really well
from personal experience.

00:19:25.363 --> 00:19:28.846
But with the right help,
we can understand these problems

00:19:28.870 --> 00:19:31.344
and we can fix these problems together.